se}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathrm{pm}}\\in V\">\\(L_{\\mathrm{pm}}\\in V\\)</span> 是本定义固定的前鼠语言参数；所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S\\)</span> 调用均使用这个相同参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}sound\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S(\\mathcal M,\\rho,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(\\mathcal M,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}sound\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S(\\mathcal M,\\rho,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcInnerSoundPremouse}_S(\\mathcal M,L_{\\mathrm{pm}},\\rho,p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This numbering-specific predicate reuses the canonical definition whose projectum, parameter, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> hull are explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"3e2c90c7f1f68c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner-sound-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"3